From 079eb25a85ea8fea931472a620277ab797230651 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <root@your.mom>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 09:31:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(deepseek-v41): compose virtual heads for TP3

Upstream base: 0f2a15c9277f34c9afe141cf578d1f02b3bebdfe

Rationale: Map checkpoint groups through native loaders into virtual TP3 attention geometry.
Quality and speed: Preserves original 64/8 computation and native weight transforms.
Tests: source replay, syntax parse, and diff check; target hardware qualification pending.
Upstream status: local candidate, not submitted.
